"Pre-sale document with items and pricing. No payment section. Includes validity notice and terms."
msgstr ""
"Documento pré-venda com itens e preços. Sem seção de pagamento. Inclui aviso de validade e termos."

#. translators: Gallery template name shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:485
msgid "Standard Receipt"
msgstr "Recibo padrão"

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:487
msgid ""
"Streamlined receipt with logo, store info, itemized lines, totals and payment — covers what most stores need without the kitchen sink."
msgstr ""
"Recibo enxuto com logo, informações da loja, linhas itemizadas, totais e pagamento — cobre o que a maioria das lojas precisa sem exageros."

#. translators: Gallery template name shown in the admin Template Gallery. The (RTL) suffix marks right-to-left layout.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:498
msgid "Standard Receipt (RTL)"
msgstr "Recibo padrão (RTL)"

